unting. How do Serbs feel about the matter?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Germany: Is Saxony-Anhalt's economy really struggling?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cb7f100d39faf1be154dcbc1385cdc89adb018eb47ac0fb80f6ebff6d13b08c8</id><updated>2026-09-04T19:01:31Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T10:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-is-saxony-anhalt-s-economy-really-struggling/a-78867143--663312ee9c4c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-is-saxony-anhalt-s-economy-really-struggling/a-78867143?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's far-right AfD party has long claimed that the eastern state of Saxony-Anhalt has been left behind. Is that really the case? A closer look at the data offers some interesting insights.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Why the North Korean women's football team is so good</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7be7da81599654efa64cfd609ebe1608417efb82f98eaa9b5492ed6413b3238a</id><updated>2026-09-04T19:01:31Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T10:01:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-the-north-korean-women-s-football-team-is-so-good/a-70313505--17727eebb1a9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-the-north-korean-women-s-football-team-is-so-good/a-70313505?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">North Korea's young footballers enter the U-20 World Cup in Poland as defending champions — the 2024 title was their third. Why is the isolated state so good at the game?</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>India news: ISRO launces first imaging satellite into orbit</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5a263255f1af5c818c23f0df151bf2c653ea4bde1050d303917f0a45aaecbfd4</id><updated>2026-09-04T19:01:31Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T08:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/indi